{"id":"vod_bf_8891","vodId":"8891","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"EVA爆笑学园","name_cn":"EVA爆笑学园","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-10/845b838788c4d2d9df774daf1dd54a31.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在一所名叫第3新东京世立NERV学园中，校长是严肃又寡言的碇原度（立木文彦 配音）。作为校长的儿子，碇真嗣（绪方惠美 配音）感到压力很大。于此同时，来自外国的红发转学生明日香（宫村优子 配音），分裂成三个、以姐妹的形式出场的凌波丽（林原惠美 配音）都给碇真嗣的学校生活带来了翻天覆地的变化。此外，在原作中高大帅气的初号机，也将以娇小可爱的形象，作为学院的一份子出现在动画中。　　动画以《新世界福音战士》中的角色为原型，一改原作沉重严肃的气氛，描述了轻松愉快的校园生活。制作方首次采用了3D的Q版造型，配以实景背景和2D拼接，造就了多元化的绘画风格。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 00:39:42","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/EVAbaoxiaoxueyuan/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/EVAbaoxiaoxueyuan/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/EVAbaoxiaoxueyuan/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/EVAbaoxiaoxueyuan/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/EVAbaoxiaoxueyuan/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/EVAbaoxiaoxueyuan/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/EVAbaoxiaoxueyuan/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/EVAbaoxiaoxueyuan/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/EVAbaoxiaoxueyuan/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/EVAbaoxiaoxueyuan/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/EVAbaoxiaoxueyuan/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/EVAbaoxiaoxueyuan/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/EVAbaoxiaoxueyuan/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/vid